1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,052
Here's a conscious zombie story.

2
00:00:04,253 --> 00:00:06,363
I had an idea the other day.

3
00:00:06,464 --> 00:00:07,698
I saw a zombie,

4
00:00:07,698 --> 00:00:10,913
and its brothers and sisters were zombies as well...

5
00:00:10,913 --> 00:00:14,212
and they were running towards the Fortress of Humanity.

6
00:00:14,512 --> 00:00:16,667
And Humanity was defending itself,

7
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,108
tearing those zombies into dust...

8
00:00:19,108 --> 00:00:23,352
to protect themselves from the scariness of the mindless zombies.

9
00:00:24,352 --> 00:00:27,446
But then I saw a soul descend from the heavens...

10
00:00:27,646 --> 00:00:29,972
and it fell into one of the zombies.

11
00:00:32,271 --> 00:00:34,792
And that zombie started looking around...

12
00:00:35,393 --> 00:00:37,348
ZOMBIE: I... I can see.

13
00:00:38,048 --> 00:00:39,871
and it froze in place.

14
00:00:40,871 --> 00:00:42,911
It had control of itself.

15
00:00:43,411 --> 00:00:45,667
ZOMBIE: These are... my hands.

16
00:00:46,366 --> 00:00:49,561
But it did not have control of what it could witness...

17
00:00:49,561 --> 00:00:50,993
or what it could feel.

18
00:00:51,893 --> 00:00:54,709
Its brothers and sisters, who looked just like it,

19
00:00:54,709 --> 00:00:57,710
seemed compelled to run to the battlefield.

20
00:00:58,009 --> 00:01:00,109
ZOMBIE: Wait... where are you going?

21
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:04,099
It saw them being destroyed by the Fortress of Humanity.

22
00:01:04,099 --> 00:01:05,745
It saw their suffering...

23
00:01:05,745 --> 00:01:08,108
even though they were not conscious.

24
00:01:08,808 --> 00:01:10,164
And then the pain started.

25
00:01:10,164 --> 00:01:12,224
Because now it could feel their pain.

26
00:01:12,224 --> 00:01:13,825
All of their pain.

27
00:01:14,224 --> 00:01:16,631
ZOMBIE: It hurts... it all hurts.

28
00:01:17,331 --> 00:01:20,215
Now that this soul-infused zombie was conscious,

29
00:01:20,215 --> 00:01:24,108
it was a witness. A witness to the suffering in the world.

30
00:01:25,108 --> 00:01:28,423
And the conscious zombie thought it was alone in its suffering.

31
00:01:28,423 --> 00:01:31,492
It fell to its knees, and it covered its face,

32
00:01:31,492 --> 00:01:34,245
to try to suppress the pain it had witnessed.

33
00:01:34,945 --> 00:01:38,036
It had no other consciousness to share that suffering with,

34
00:01:38,036 --> 00:01:39,551
as far as it knew.

35
00:01:39,551 --> 00:01:43,528
So maybe it was the only one giving the suffering around it meaning.

36
00:01:44,227 --> 00:01:46,753
Because before that body of flesh was conscious,

37
00:01:46,753 --> 00:01:48,602
the suffering had no meaning.

38
00:01:48,602 --> 00:01:52,293
But when a soul descended from heaven and created a witness...

39
00:01:52,293 --> 00:01:54,727
the suffering had meaning now.

40
00:01:55,528 --> 00:01:58,237
ZOMBIE: Why... why was I picked to witness this?

41
00:01:58,237 --> 00:01:59,957
ZOMBIE: What does it mean?

42
00:02:00,858 --> 00:02:03,537
What power is there to give meaning to suffering?

43
00:02:03,537 --> 00:02:06,888
To be on your knees, with tears falling from your eyes,

44
00:02:06,888 --> 00:02:09,638
as you witness others who cannot share it with you...

45
00:02:09,638 --> 00:02:11,937
but you are giving their suffering meaning,

46
00:02:11,937 --> 00:02:13,788
by seeing their pain.

47
00:02:15,087 --> 00:02:16,995
ZOMBIE: Is anyone there?

48
00:02:18,694 --> 00:02:20,909
But there is no answer from the heavens.

49
00:02:20,909 --> 00:02:24,224
Because the heavens gave their answer when they sent the soul,

50
00:02:24,224 --> 00:02:26,622
and put it into a body of flesh.

51
00:02:27,022 --> 00:02:30,293
And now that body of flesh needs to find its own answer,

52
00:02:30,293 --> 00:02:32,549
to what the suffering means for it.

53
00:02:33,248 --> 00:02:36,644
Maybe heaven's answer and heaven's question were the same thing...

54
00:02:36,644 --> 00:02:38,340
your existence.

55
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:40,724
And maybe, if they knew more,

56
00:02:40,724 --> 00:02:42,444
they would have already solved it.

57
00:02:42,444 --> 00:02:45,495
But your own ability to witness, on a deep level,

58
00:02:45,495 --> 00:02:48,459
might give you the details you need to help them.

59
00:02:49,158 --> 00:02:51,739
What if heaven sent the soul into a kind of hell...

60
00:02:51,739 --> 00:02:54,084
not to take the highway towards hell,

61
00:02:54,084 --> 00:02:56,426
but to better know what to avoid?

62
00:02:56,826 --> 00:03:00,407
Because the staircase to heaven is not a simple staircase.

63
00:03:00,407 --> 00:03:05,342
It is built by transforming the suffering of hell into well-being and peace.

64
00:03:06,442 --> 00:03:10,042
And when the conscious zombie had cried all of the tears that it could...

65
00:03:10,042 --> 00:03:13,074
it looked around, and it saw a building.

66
00:03:13,474 --> 00:03:15,616
ZOMBIE: I have to do something.

67
00:03:16,317 --> 00:03:18,979
It climbed a ladder to the top of the building...

68
00:03:19,579 --> 00:03:21,598
and there, it saw a flag.

69
00:03:22,298 --> 00:03:25,078
It grabbed the flag and started waving it in the air,

70
00:03:25,078 --> 00:03:27,068
because it had to do something.

71
00:03:27,168 --> 00:03:29,675
ZOMBIE: Stop! Please... stop!

72
00:03:30,175 --> 00:03:33,000
It couldn't watch all of its brothers and sisters die.

73
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,949
The pain was unbearable.

74
00:03:34,949 --> 00:03:37,201
The suffering was unbearable.

75
00:03:38,201 --> 00:03:41,539
And then, a human helicopter came flying over.

76
00:03:42,139 --> 00:03:43,409
A rope came down,

77
00:03:43,409 --> 00:03:46,056
and one of the humans dropped down the rope...

78
00:03:46,257 --> 00:03:48,622
grabbed the conscious zombie by the shirt,

79
00:03:48,622 --> 00:03:50,968
and pulled them up into the helicopter.

80
00:03:52,269 --> 00:03:54,794
The conscious zombie thought it was going to be shot...

81
00:03:54,794 --> 00:03:56,868
killed, like the others.

82
00:03:57,968 --> 00:04:00,943
But then it saw that the humans were looking at it.

83
00:04:01,843 --> 00:04:03,326
PILOT: Who are you?

84
00:04:04,326 --> 00:04:05,849
ZOMBIE: I don't know.

85
00:04:06,250 --> 00:04:08,754
ZOMBIE: I am a zombie... I think.

86
00:04:10,955 --> 00:04:12,756
CREW: We think you are conscious.

87
00:04:13,855 --> 00:04:15,688
ZOMBIE: How can you tell?

88
00:04:17,889 --> 00:04:21,084
PILOT: Because you can feel the pain of your brothers and sisters...

89
00:04:21,084 --> 00:04:23,500
CREW: and you can feel the weight of the world.

90
00:04:23,901 --> 00:04:25,315
PILOT: That's what humans feel.

91
00:04:25,315 --> 00:04:27,389
PILOT: And we think you feel that too.

92
00:04:28,788 --> 00:04:30,886
And the conscious zombie nodded.

93
00:04:32,586 --> 00:04:35,016
Without hell, which existed before heaven,

94
00:04:35,016 --> 00:04:37,261
heaven could not have been formed.

95
00:04:37,661 --> 00:04:39,701
And that is why heaven sent the soul...

96
00:04:39,701 --> 00:04:41,696
to turn hell into heaven.
